 "intro_zh": "景区占地面积约500平方米，涵括孙中山故居纪念馆、翠亨村、中山城、辛亥革命纪念公园和犁头尖山五个核心景区景点，全方位呈现了孙中山从出生成长到进行革命活动的相关历史遗迹。",
 "intro_en": "The scenic area covers an area of ​​about 500 square meters and includes five core scenic spots: Sun Yat-sen’s Former Residence Memorial Hall, Cuiheng Village, Zhongshan City, Xinhai Revolution Memorial Park and Litoujianshan. It comprehensively presents the relevant historical relics of Sun Yat-sen from his birth and growth to his revolutionary activities.",
